{{also|saa|saA}}
==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|s|ä}}

===Etymology 1===
From the {{proto|Finno-Ugric|sänge|lang=fi}}, a cognate of Hungarian {{term|ég}}.

====Noun====
{{infl|fi|noun}}

# [[weather]]
#:* [[hyvä]]llä ''säällä'' = on good ''weather''
#:* [[huono]]lla ''säällä'' = on bad ''weather''

=====Declension=====
{{fi-decl-maa|sä|ä|ä}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{sense|weather}} [[ilma]]

=====Derived terms=====
* ''[[hyvän sään aikana|hyvän ~n aikana]]'' = before it's too late (''literally'': "during the good weather")

=====Compounds=====
* [[sääennuste]]
* [[sääilmiö]]
* [[säätila]]

====See also====
* [[ilmasto]]

===Etymology 2===
From {{term|sinä}}.

====Pronoun====
{{infl|fi|pronoun}}

# {{Häme dialect ~Tampere and Turku}} [[you]] (''addressing one person; in archaic English'': [[thou]]).
#:* ''[[mikä|Mitä]] '''sää''' [[tehdä|teet]]?''
#:** ''What are '''you''' doing?''

